        "content": "## Automatic catalog sync\nRuns every 5 minutes and right after an admin uses !stock / !harga.\n1. Read both sheet tabs. If nothing changed since the last sync, stop (no Gemini calls).\n2. On change: upsert the products table, write a new vector version to Qdrant,\n   then delete every vector older than this run (HUMI never loses product data, no duplicates).\n3. Report to #admin-hmns.\nManual Trigger = force a full re-sync.",
